title: Market
tags: chapter_1 emberfall_market
---
Tarin: Fresh lamps, dry tinder, and questions that cost extra. #line:market_tarin_greeting
<<if $has_watch_map>>
    Mara: Tarin marked a maintenance stair beneath the watchtower. #line:market_map_route
<<elseif $mara_trust > 0>>
    Mara: Stay close. I know another way past the patrol. #line:market_trusted_route
<<else>>
    Tarin: Without a map, the front gate is your only road. #line:market_no_route
<<endif>>
-> Follow Mara toward the maintenance stair #line:market_follow
    Mara: Keep your hood up and let me speak first. #line:market_follow_reply
    <<jump Watchtower>>
-> Ask Tarin who warned the watch <<if $mara_trust >= 1>> #line:market_question
    Tarin: Captain Ilyra paid for every rumour before sunset. #line:market_warning
    <<set $watch_alerted to true>>
    <<jump Watchtower>>
===
